# Boneless (THUG): tap up twice, then release the ollie: a foot comes off and the pop is 20%
# stronger. From a full charge the ollie rises about 1.66 m (1.15 m plain), and "Boneless" banks.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -12 0.13 90
hold ollie 10..40
tap up 28
tap up 34
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=Boneless} within 40..42
expect max skater.pos.z > 1.7
expect max skater.pos.z < 1.85
expect skater.footTrick == boneless at 60
expect event comboLanded{name=Boneless} within 150..260
expect no event bail
